  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 16 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 16 & 8\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(2-0)i-(-2-0)j+(-8-16)k \\\\  & =2i+2j-24k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120555 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186360402 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120555 #edb/ref 1069 "q-96943" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120555 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120555 #edb/ref 1071 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨-2,\\,3,\\,4⟩$\nand\n${\\int }_{2}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨8,\\,-6,\\,15⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120555 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "29982efe-8588-56f9-8a2e-657a512dab79" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120555 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the adjacent intervals rule, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{2}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{2}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nFinally, using the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t-{\\int }_{2}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨-2,\\,3,\\,4⟩-⟨8,\\,-6,\\,15⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-10,\\,9,\\,-11⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120789 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186120791 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120789 #edb/ref 1061 32283 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120789 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b9eea760-99ae-5d7b-82d5-ea90245e119d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120789 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186119879 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120790 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186120789 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120790 #edb/ref 1061 32530 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186120790 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "660b20a9-f073-51b0-a1b7-e72f161ebfb3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17